    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Born in late-19th-century Andalusia to poor farmers, Salvador joined the Anarquista movement and later the Mano Negra before being nearly beaten to death by police alongside his brother Pablo, who did not survive. The mysterious @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZFYurbvAHfaRguYI]{Brujah} Ferdinand Embraced him, and Salvador continued the fight against oppression, and against the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.OpCOs3PLjmtl0QVu]{Ventrue}-dominated @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla}, through the Spanish Civil War until Ferdinand's destruction collapsed the Spanish anarch movement. He fled to Los Angeles, where — alongside Jeremy MacNeil, Crispus Attucks, and Marguerite Foccart — he helped plan and execute the 1944 Revolt, personally credited with killing Don Sebastian in single combat (in truth, an unknown, far more powerful attacker did the deed; Salvador smeared himself in the Don's blood and took the credit to protect the Revolt's morale). He later sat on the short-lived Revolutionary Council and authored the founding document of the Free States, the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.rules-reference.JournalEntry.St7uVm2DqK4nRy8X]{Status} Perfectus, as well as the widely-read \"An Anarch Manifesto.\"</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Salvador is the de facto leader of El Hermandad, the anarch faction centered on East Los Angeles, and supplies equipment and riot training to revolutionary movements across the Americas. He is a passionate, straightforward believer in the Free States' philosophy of non-interference, even when it costs him personally — he made no effort to stop his childe Allison Maller from seizing the Barony of Anaheim through slaughter, despite grieving the loss of her idealism.</p>",
    "notes": "Haven: various, largely among ghoul retainers in the barrios of East Los Angeles; frequently travels through Mexico and Central/South America. Closest friend and second-in-command: Jesus Ramirez. Childe: Allison Maller, now Baroness of Anaheim.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
